    {"entry_index":40,"uid":"zhcn:92ae929d4685c83a15db8767","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"お知らせが来ているわ。\r\n果たし状でもまじっていれば、\r\n退屈しのぎになるのだけれど。","source_fingerprint":"e6c393de0d73a098cb354e8506d9393066e149042ece849773764d719cd50539","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1116","10015"],"target_text":"Có thông báo gửi tới này.\r\nGiá mà trong đó lẫn một lá thư thách đấu\r\nthì cũng đủ giúp tôi giết thời gian.","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":41,"uid":"zhcn:1b745f63f8924523a3c0cd70","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"贈答品が届いていますわ。\r\n鬼が出るか蛇が出るか…。\r\nおほほ、冗談ですわ。","source_fingerprint":"a7d0c110cf142c67d94bf935794d355e3de1c4db793fd5bda46c22acd9ad2f66","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1116","10016"],"target_text":"Có quà gửi tới rồi.\r\nKhông biết sẽ lòi ra quỷ hay rắn đây…\r\nOhoho, tôi đùa thôi.","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":42,"uid":"zhcn:9084e09dd896b4365b60782f","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"ミッション達成、\r\nおめでとうございます。\r\n今後とも期待していますわ？","source_fingerprint":"0cdf365c027370eb47d15b1bc93a0292f202562ecdd437b543bc4aa8ebabe645","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1116","10017"],"target_text":"Chúc mừng anh\r\nđã hoàn thành nhiệm vụ.\r\nTừ giờ tôi vẫn sẽ kỳ vọng vào anh đấy nhé?","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":43,"uid":"zhcn:8c7feee16fae27104b508bdd","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"イベントの告知が出ていますわね。\r\nどんな強者が現れるのか…\r\nふふ、興味深いわ。","source_fingerprint":"be67ae17c52728a461621ed653e2a3bdc681826147fa413c57aa404ae52a6d57","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1116","10018"],"target_text":"Thông báo sự kiện đã ra rồi nhỉ.\r\nKhông biết sẽ xuất hiện những kẻ mạnh nào…\r\nFufu, thú vị đấy.","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":44,"uid":"zhcn:1803e9836cb3812a2d415674","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"イベントが始まったようね。\r\nつつがなく、\r\n私をエスコートしてくださる？","source_fingerprint":"58842b0cff2126ddaa210179337160456e0dc387be329ac6fc55d2ce6c234aff","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1116","10019"],"target_text":"Có vẻ sự kiện đã bắt đầu rồi.\r\nAnh sẽ hộ tống tôi\r\nchu toàn chứ?","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":45,"uid":"zhcn:10c9e7bd60c5f4f4da12a3de","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"鍛え直すわよ。","source_fingerprint":"0b7dd0422aa5dc6f1a0546a6aae08097ceb6c203264de0e97ca1edc5eff42be6","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1116","1002"],"target_text":"Tôi sẽ rèn anh lại từ đầu.","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":46,"uid":"zhcn:bcd2959ecacc29eafda67693","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"名鑑のレベルが上がったみたいね。\r\nさ、どんどん励んでくださいな。","source_fingerprint":"cdeb8d24309d35be2936f96ca884f451a3eb982eab86e7d687e1575e27d3ad95","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1116","10021"],"target_text":"Có vẻ Cấp Danh bạ đã tăng rồi.\r\nNào, cứ tiếp tục cố gắng nhé.","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":47,"uid":"zhcn:8733392c8d3839b4a21357a0","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"お強いのね。","source_fingerprint":"c08741021f04fe59c48e80f2854c79f4346a54485000cbee37df9bb31e54274c","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1116","1003"],"target_text":"Mạnh thật đấy.","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":48,"uid":"zhcn:0ba7a1853e9e32449472173c","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"あら、お終い？","source_fingerprint":"38b28491933d4232e2aca681cebed401f48da4a0d52c8558f2b2205088774901","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1116","1004"],"target_text":"Ồ, hết rồi à?","reviewed":true},
